DomainSuffix.description:
Canonical DNS suffix. A bare domain matches itself and descendant labels;
a leading `*.` is accepted only as an explicit spelling of that same
complete-label boundary rule. It never performs substring matching.

NodeNetworkJoinPreview.description:
Complete, signed disclosure shown before a direct local join. It contains
public governance metadata only: no member addresses, topology, activity,
invitation credentials or private keys cross this boundary.

TrafficFailureDecision.description:
A complete, serializable failure decision. `consequence_key` is a stable
localization key that both GPUI and WebUI must display before policy apply;
no localized prose is duplicated in the domain layer.
